{
  "id": "6a69b260ac14349dbb3f31e7",
  "title": "見つけた井戸端のUsnrCSSの重そうなスタイル指定（あとで直すための一時的なメモ） Nrem",
  "created": 1785311843,
  "updated": 1785312518,
  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "6a69b297000000000069fea8",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785311901,
      "updated": 1785311901
    },
    {
      "id": "6a69b260ac14349dbb3f31e7",
      "text": "見つけた井戸端のUsnrCSSの重そうなスタイル指定（あとで直すための一時的なメモ）[Nrem.icon]",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785311843,
      "updated": 1785312499
    },
    {
      "id": "6a69b262000000000069fe88",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785311843,
      "updated": 1785311843
    },
    {
      "id": "6a69b262000000000069fe8a",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785311843,
      "updated": 1785311843
    },
    {
      "id": "6a69b28c000000000069fea7",
      "text": "[特定のリンクにアイコンをつけるUserCSS]",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785311885,
      "updated": 1785311958
    },
    {
      "id": "6a69b32d000000000069fead",
      "text": "箇所",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785312046,
      "updated": 1785312049
    },
    {
      "id": "6a69b2d0000000000069fea9",
      "text": " >  Wikipedia：サンプル（[https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/増井俊之 増井俊之]）[. [https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/増井俊之 増井俊之]]",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785311953,
      "updated": 1785312039
    },
    {
      "id": "6a69b2d0000000000069feaa",
      "text": " >  \t任意の言語の Wikipedia （例：[https://my.wikipedia.org/wiki/ဗမာနိုင်ငံတော် ဗမာနိုင်ငံတော်]）に適応されるようにする。[Summer498.icon]",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785311953,
      "updated": 1785312039
    },
    {
      "id": "6a69b264000000000069fe8d",
      "text": "    code:style.css",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785311848,
      "updated": 1785312039
    },
    {
      "id": "6a69b264000000000069fe8e",
      "text": "     :is(.line, .line .deco) a.link:is(",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785311848,
      "updated": 1785312039
    },
    {
      "id": "6a69b264000000000069fe8f",
      "text": "       [href*=\".wikipedia.org\"]",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785311848,
      "updated": 1785312039
    },
    {
      "id": "6a69b264000000000069fe90",
      "text": "     )::before {",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785311848,
      "updated": 1785312039
    },
    {
      "id": "6a69b264000000000069fe91",
      "text": "       content: '\\f266';",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785311848,
      "updated": 1785312039
    },
    {
      "id": "6a69b264000000000069fe92",
      "text": "       font-weight: 400;",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785311848,
      "updated": 1785312039
    },
    {
      "id": "6a69b264000000000069fe93",
      "text": "       margin-right: 3px;",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785311848,
      "updated": 1785312039
    },
    {
      "id": "6a69b264000000000069fe94",
      "text": "     }",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785311848,
      "updated": 1785312039
    },
    {
      "id": "6a69b264000000000069fe95",
      "text": " >   [リンクを出典アイコンにするUserCSS]を使った場合は、wikipediaのタイトルだけを表示する",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785311848,
      "updated": 1785312039
    },
    {
      "id": "6a69b2e1000000000069feab",
      "text": " >    URLは`https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/:pagename`という形式なので、先頭から30文字だけ非表示にすればいい",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785311970,
      "updated": 1785312039
    },
    {
      "id": "6a69b2e1000000000069feac",
      "text": " >    `.char-index`はCSSの優先度を上げるために付けている",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785311970,
      "updated": 1785312039
    },
    {
      "id": "6a69b264000000000069fe98",
      "text": "    code:style.css",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785311848,
      "updated": 1785312039
    },
    {
      "id": "6a69b264000000000069fe99",
      "text": "     .line .deco-\\. a.link:is(",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785311848,
      "updated": 1785312039
    },
    {
      "id": "6a69b264000000000069fe9a",
      "text": "       [href*=\".wikipedia.org\"]",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785311848,
      "updated": 1785312039
    },
    {
      "id": "6a69b264000000000069fe9b",
      "text": "     ) span.char-index {",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785311848,
      "updated": 1785312039
    },
    {
      "id": "6a69b264000000000069fe9c",
      "text": "       display: inline-block;",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785311848,
      "updated": 1785312039
    },
    {
      "id": "6a69b264000000000069fe9d",
      "text": "       width: 0;",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785311848,
      "updated": 1785312039
    },
    {
      "id": "6a69b264000000000069fe9e",
      "text": "       text-indent: -9999px;",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785311848,
      "updated": 1785312039
    },
    {
      "id": "6a69b264000000000069fe9f",
      "text": "     }",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785311848,
      "updated": 1785312039
    },
    {
      "id": "6a69b264000000000069fea0",
      "text": "     .line .deco-\\. a.link:is(",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785311848,
      "updated": 1785312039
    },
    {
      "id": "6a69b264000000000069fea1",
      "text": "       [href*=\".wikipedia.org\"]",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785311848,
      "updated": 1785312039
    },
    {
      "id": "6a69b264000000000069fea2",
      "text": "     ) span.char-index:nth-of-type(30) ~ span.char-index {",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785311848,
      "updated": 1785312039
    },
    {
      "id": "6a69b264000000000069fea3",
      "text": "       display: inherit;",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785311848,
      "updated": 1785312039
    },
    {
      "id": "6a69b264000000000069fea4",
      "text": "       width: inherit;",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785311848,
      "updated": 1785312039
    },
    {
      "id": "6a69b264000000000069fea5",
      "text": "       text-indent: inherit;",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785311848,
      "updated": 1785312039
    },
    {
      "id": "6a69b264000000000069fea6",
      "text": "     }",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785311848,
      "updated": 1785312039
    },
    {
      "id": "6a69b3ee000000000031a5a6",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785312239,
      "updated": 1785312239
    },
    {
      "id": "6a69b333000000000069feae",
      "text": "メモ",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785312053,
      "updated": 1785312482
    },
    {
      "id": "6a69b33f000000000069feb0",
      "text": "`:nth-of-type`は`>`結合子と組み合わせるべき",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785312064,
      "updated": 1785312291
    },
    {
      "id": "6a69b350000000000069feb2",
      "text": " ページ内の全ての`.char-index`が走査される可能性がある",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785312081,
      "updated": 1785312282
    },
    {
      "id": "6a69b33f000000000069feaf",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785312064,
      "updated": 1785312064
    },
    {
      "id": "6a69b3e7000000000031a5a5",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785312232,
      "updated": 1785312232
    },
    {
      "id": "6a69b3d5000000000031a59d",
      "text": "[リンクを出典アイコンにするUserCSS：実装ページ]",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785312214,
      "updated": 1785312220
    },
    {
      "id": "6a69b3e4000000000031a5a4",
      "text": "箇所",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785312229,
      "updated": 1785312231
    },
    {
      "id": "6a69b3dd000000000031a5a0",
      "text": "　無名のspan",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785312222,
      "updated": 1785312222
    },
    {
      "id": "6a69b3dd000000000031a5a1",
      "text": "　　`.line:not(.cursor-line) .deco-\\. a:is(.page-link:not(.icon), .link) span:not(.empty-char-index) + span + span ~ span {`",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785312222,
      "updated": 1785312222
    },
    {
      "id": "6a69b3dd000000000031a5a2",
      "text": "　.char-index",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785312222,
      "updated": 1785312518
    },
    {
      "id": "6a69b3dd000000000031a5a3",
      "text": "　　`.page-link:not(.icon) span.empty-char-index ~ span.char-index {`",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785312222,
      "updated": 1785312222
    },
    {
      "id": "6a69b3db000000000031a59e",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785312220,
      "updated": 1785312220
    }
  ]
}